## **Output Format**
   - **explanation**: Briefly justify your choice in 1-2 sentences, naming the decision rule you applied if any.
   - **label**: Provide only one of "GI", "Persuade", "PwP", "Q", "SR", "CR", "AF", "Seek", "Emphasize", "Confront", "NC".
